Dialogue: 1,0:00:13.32,0:00:19.37,Target Karaoke,,0,0,0,,Furusupiido de mawari hajimeta sutoorii
Dialogue: 1,0:00:19.37,0:00:24.16,Target Karaoke,,0,0,0,,akaku daichi someageru
Dialogue: 1,0:00:25.46,0:00:31.71,Target Karaoke,,0,0,0,,Chikyuugi ni wa garandou ni natta paradise
Dialogue: 1,0:00:31.71,0:00:36.39,Target Karaoke,,0,0,0,,Bokura no te de sukuidasou
Dialogue: 1,0:00:37.34,0:00:43.02,Target Karaoke,,0,0,0,,Hateshinaku tsuzuku sakamichi o
Dialogue: 1,0:00:43.02,0:00:47.73,Target Karaoke,,0,0,0,,Ima omoikiri kakenukete far away
Dialogue: 1,0:00:51.40,0:00:57.24,Target Karaoke,,0,0,0,,Tachiagare! Yuusha wa boku no naka ni iru
Dialogue: 1,0:00:57.87,0:01:03.79,Target Karaoke,,0,0,0,,Sobietatsu target makeru wake ni wa ikanai
Dialogue: 0,0:00:59.08,0:01:02.34,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Targets. I'm waiting for\Nyou. To wait for you.
Dialogue: 1,0:01:03.79,0:01:09.79,Target Karaoke,,0,0,0,,Moeagare! Kodou wa mune o kogashiteru
Dialogue: 0,0:01:06.38,0:01:12.42,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,I'm going to burn my heart.\NI'm going to die the next day.
Dialogue: 1,0:01:09.79,0:01:16.43,Target Karaoke,,0,0,0,,Wasurerareta ashita torimodoshi ni ikun da
Dialogue: 0,0:01:12.50,0:01:17.18,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,I'm going to die the next day.\NI'm going to die the next day.
Dialogue: 1,0:01:16.43,0:01:21.56,Target Karaoke,,0,0,0,,Atsui batoru okose
Dialogue: 0,0:01:30.48,0:01:34.46,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,We all returned to the digital world so\Nwe could rebuild the primary village,
Dialogue: 0,0:01:34.54,0:01:36.84,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,which was damaged during\Nour battles with Ken.
Dialogue: 0,0:01:36.92,0:01:40.30,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,It was hard work, but we had fun\Nplaying with the baby Punimon.
Dialogue: 0,0:01:40.38,0:01:42.26,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,While Digmon and I were working,
Dialogue: 0,0:01:42.38,0:01:43.78,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,We were attacked by Thundermon.
Dialogue: 0,0:01:43.86,0:01:47.40,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,And for the first time, Armadyllamon\Ndigifogged to Aquilamon.
Dialogue: 0,0:01:47.48,0:01:49.56,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,He couldn't defeat Thundermon on his own.
Dialogue: 0,0:01:49.64,0:01:53.90,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,but suddenly Stingmon appeared and saved\Nme while helping to destroy Thundermon.
Dialogue: 0,0:01:53.98,0:01:55.34,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,I didn't know who he was,
Dialogue: 0,0:01:55.42,0:01:57.42,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,but it became clear when Ken showed up and
Dialogue: 0,0:01:57.50,0:02:00.52,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Stingmon returned to a\Nform we all recognized.
Dialogue: 0,0:02:01.12,0:02:01.95,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Wormmon.
Dialogue: 1,0:02:03.64,0:02:10.02,Title,,0,0,0,,{\fad(400,0)\fscx110\fscy110\pos(316,329)}Knight of the Skies, Aquilamon
Dialogue: 0,0:02:09.72,0:02:12.18,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,I think Kari's a total babe, dude.
Dialogue: 0,0:02:12.26,0:02:15.74,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,What's with Davis and his\Ngoggles? Lunchroom duty. Yuck.
Dialogue: 0,0:02:16.42,0:02:17.32,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,I know what you mean.
Dialogue: 0,0:02:17.40,0:02:19.26,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,These outfits are totally humiliating.
Dialogue: 0,0:02:19.34,0:02:20.22,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,You said it.
Dialogue: 0,0:02:20.48,0:02:22.98,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,We look like a couple of\Nsalt and pepper shakers.
Dialogue: 0,0:02:23.06,0:02:25.52,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Or mad scientists. Ew. Yuck.
Dialogue: 0,0:02:25.74,0:02:28.56,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,You know, maybe Ken isn't\Nsuch a bad guy after all.
Dialogue: 0,0:02:28.64,0:02:29.56,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,I'm not sure.
Dialogue: 0,0:02:29.82,0:02:31.17,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,He helped us last time.
Dialogue: 0,0:02:31.58,0:02:32.46,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,I don't know.
Dialogue: 0,0:02:32.72,0:02:33.98,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,He'll have to prove it to me.
Dialogue: 0,0:02:34.06,0:02:35.66,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,He's done some evil things in the past.
Dialogue: 0,0:02:35.74,0:02:37.74,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Hey, man, I want my lunch already.
Dialogue: 0,0:02:39.30,0:02:41.26,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Technically, Ken is one\Nof the Digidestined.
Dialogue: 0,0:02:41.34,0:02:43.87,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,I was thinking of asking\Nhim to join our...
Dialogue: 0,0:02:44.10,0:02:47.94,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,I guess that's a no from Cody. I\Ndon't know. It was just an idea.
Dialogue: 0,0:02:48.72,0:02:50.49,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,I thought maybe he could help.
Dialogue: 0,0:02:51.16,0:02:54.28,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,I guess someone hasn't had\Ntheir coffee this morning.
Dialogue: 0,0:02:54.54,0:02:56.72,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Ken, one of us? Impossible.
Dialogue: 0,0:02:57.18,0:02:59.58,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,When he was the Digimon\NEmperor, he was ruthless.
Dialogue: 0,0:02:59.66,0:03:01.56,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,He might be pulling another trick on us.
Dialogue: 0,0:03:01.64,0:03:02.88,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,I think Ken's changed.
Dialogue: 0,0:03:02.96,0:03:04.94,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,He's not the Digimon Emperor anymore.
Dialogue: 0,0:03:05.02,0:03:06.06,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,I don't know.
Dialogue: 0,0:03:06.34,0:03:07.34,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,What do you mean?
Dialogue: 0,0:03:07.52,0:03:10.36,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,I thought Ken changed too,\Nespecially after Wormon got hurt.
Dialogue: 0,0:03:10.44,0:03:12.30,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,it seemed like he finally\Nrealized that Digimon
Dialogue: 0,0:03:12.38,0:03:14.12,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,were living creatures that have feelings.
Dialogue: 0,0:03:14.20,0:03:17.06,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,But after our last battle in the\Ndigital world, I'm not so sure.
Dialogue: 0,0:03:17.14,0:03:19.79,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,He seemed a whole lot\Nlike the old kin to me.
Dialogue: 0,0:03:20.92,0:03:24.56,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,The way he mercilessly ordered\NStingmon to go in for the kill.
Dialogue: 0,0:03:24.64,0:03:25.88,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,The poor Digimon.
Dialogue: 0,0:03:26.64,0:03:27.92,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,It was just horrible.
Dialogue: 0,0:03:28.86,0:03:32.12,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,I'm sorry, Davis, but I don't think I\Ncan trust him, not after what he did.
Dialogue: 0,0:03:32.20,0:03:33.66,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,No one ever believes me.
Dialogue: 0,0:03:33.84,0:03:35.96,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,I'll just have to do this on my own.
Dialogue: 0,0:03:36.18,0:03:37.34,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Davis, wait for me.
Dialogue: 0,0:03:37.82,0:03:39.16,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Hey, Davis, what's up?
Dialogue: 0,0:03:39.80,0:03:40.63,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Where are they going?
Dialogue: 0,0:03:40.71,0:03:43.60,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,I don't know, but I think he's mad\Nat me for disagreeing about Ken.
Dialogue: 0,0:03:43.68,0:03:44.51,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,About Ken?
Dialogue: 0,0:03:44.59,0:03:45.42,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,What's going on?
Dialogue: 0,0:03:45.51,0:03:46.34,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,He's gone nuts.
Dialogue: 0,0:03:46.42,0:03:49.80,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,He wants to ask Ken to join us, even after\Nseeing the way he treated that Digimon.
Dialogue: 0,0:03:49.88,0:03:52.34,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Davis needs to realize that\Npeople don't change that easily.
Dialogue: 0,0:03:52.42,0:03:54.36,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,I'm not so sure Davis is wrong.
Dialogue: 0,0:03:54.64,0:03:56.58,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Maybe we're being too hard on it.
Dialogue: 0,0:03:57.36,0:03:59.64,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,We have more important things\Nto worry about than Ken,
Dialogue: 0,0:03:59.72,0:04:01.82,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,like why the control spires\Nstarted working again.
Dialogue: 0,0:04:01.90,0:04:04.08,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Yeah, like the spire that\Nwas at Primary Village.
Dialogue: 0,0:04:04.16,0:04:06.08,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,You're always first to\Ncomplete the test, Ken.
Dialogue: 0,0:04:06.16,0:04:07.63,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,I'll be faster next time.
Dialogue: 0,0:04:07.86,0:04:09.44,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Look, I beat Ken on the math test.
Dialogue: 0,0:04:09.52,0:04:10.98,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Almost everyone beat him.
Dialogue: 0,0:04:11.06,0:04:11.96,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Look at the board.
Dialogue: 0,0:04:12.04,0:04:13.06,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Yeah, what happened?
Dialogue: 0,0:04:13.14,0:04:14.80,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,He used to be tops on every subject.
Dialogue: 0,0:04:14.88,0:04:16.88,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Maybe his brain is\Npossessed by an evil alien.
Dialogue: 0,0:04:16.96,0:04:18.86,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,I think your brain is possessed by a rock.
Dialogue: 0,0:04:18.94,0:04:19.84,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,It's like he's given up.
Dialogue: 0,0:04:19.92,0:04:21.24,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,They're right, I have given up.
Dialogue: 0,0:04:21.32,0:04:22.58,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,I can't focus anymore.
Dialogue: 0,0:04:22.66,0:04:24.04,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,I've got a lot on my mind.
Dialogue: 0,0:04:24.12,0:04:26.16,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,No one understands. Ken! Huh?
Dialogue: 0,0:04:29.44,0:04:30.27,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Hey!
Dialogue: 0,0:04:30.40,0:04:32.22,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,So what brings you all the way out here?
Dialogue: 0,0:04:32.30,0:04:34.34,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Did you come to remind me\Nthat I've been a bad boy?
Dialogue: 0,0:04:34.42,0:04:35.25,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Come on, Ken.
Dialogue: 0,0:04:35.33,0:04:37.76,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,You've done some pretty rotten\Nthings, but you're not an evil person.
Dialogue: 0,0:04:37.84,0:04:38.70,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,I'm not? No.
Dialogue: 0,0:04:38.88,0:04:40.94,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,The person that designed\Nthe school's lunch menu?
Dialogue: 0,0:04:41.02,0:04:42.55,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Now that's an evil person.
Dialogue: 0,0:04:43.36,0:04:44.60,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,That was a joke, Ken.
Dialogue: 0,0:04:44.88,0:04:47.14,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Sorry, I haven't been in\Na laughing mood lately.
Dialogue: 0,0:04:47.22,0:04:48.05,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,That's okay.
Dialogue: 0,0:04:48.22,0:04:49.44,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Look, I have an idea.
Dialogue: 0,0:04:49.52,0:04:50.60,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Why don't you come with me?
Dialogue: 0,0:04:50.68,0:04:52.70,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,You can meet my friends\Nand tell them you're sorry.
Dialogue: 0,0:04:52.78,0:04:53.61,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,But why?
Dialogue: 0,0:04:53.69,0:04:54.52,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,They hate me.
Dialogue: 0,0:04:54.61,0:04:55.44,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,They don't hate you, Ken.
Dialogue: 0,0:04:55.52,0:04:56.50,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,They just don't understand you.
Dialogue: 0,0:04:56.58,0:04:58.76,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,I know you're sorry for what\Nyou've done, but they don't.
Dialogue: 0,0:04:58.84,0:05:00.12,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,What makes you so special?
Dialogue: 0,0:05:00.20,0:05:01.38,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,I never said I was special.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:01.46,0:05:03.50,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,I just think you're better than\Nyou're giving yourself credit for.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:03.58,0:05:04.44,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,I'm not sure.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:04.64,0:05:07.04,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Look, the digital world's\Nbeen pretty freaky lately.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:07.12,0:05:08.18,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,We need your help.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:08.74,0:05:10.96,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,After all, you're one of us Digidestined.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:11.04,0:05:11.87,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Huh?
Dialogue: 0,0:05:12.66,0:05:13.49,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Me?
Dialogue: 0,0:05:13.57,0:05:14.40,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,A Digidestined?
Dialogue: 0,0:05:14.82,0:05:15.65,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,That's right.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:15.73,0:05:17.21,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Just one big happy family.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:17.56,0:05:18.68,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,I don't know.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:20.58,0:05:21.41,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Thanks, Davis.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:21.72,0:05:24.22,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,I appreciate you being honest\Nwith me, but it just won't work.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:24.30,0:05:25.70,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,I can't join you. What?
Dialogue: 0,0:05:25.86,0:05:26.74,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,What do you mean?
Dialogue: 0,0:05:26.82,0:05:27.65,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,I just can't.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:27.73,0:05:28.56,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Sorry.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:29.10,0:05:30.57,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Ken, where are you going?
Dialogue: 0,0:05:30.90,0:05:31.82,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Come on, Ken.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:31.90,0:05:32.74,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,We could be your friends.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:32.82,0:05:34.82,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Please don't turn your back on us.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:35.24,0:05:37.22,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,I really thought you were\Ngetting through to him.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:37.30,0:05:39.83,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Why do you think he\Ndidn't want to join us?
Dialogue: 0,0:05:40.74,0:05:44.46,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,I think he just needs time, which\Nwe don't have a whole lot of.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:45.64,0:05:48.50,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Hey, T .K., do you think\NDavis is right about Ken?
Dialogue: 0,0:05:48.58,0:05:50.76,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Should we forgive him for what he's done?
Dialogue: 0,0:05:50.84,0:05:54.14,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,I think everyone deserves a\Nsecond chance, Panama, even Ken.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:54.22,0:05:56.04,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,I believe that he's\Nsorry for what he's done,
Dialogue: 0,0:05:56.12,0:05:59.41,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,and it's time we forgive him\Nand let bygones be bygones.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:59.92,0:06:01.51,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,I hope he forgives himself.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:02.02,0:06:04.90,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,I've been thinking a lot about what\Nyou said, and the answer is still no.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:04.98,0:06:08.10,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,I'm sorry, Davis, but I\Ndon't think it's a good idea.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:09.36,0:06:11.13,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Hey, Yoli, is something wrong?
Dialogue: 0,0:06:11.56,0:06:12.39,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Huh?
Dialogue: 0,0:06:13.50,0:06:14.33,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Let's see.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:14.41,0:06:16.42,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,I'll bet it's something to do with a boy.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:16.50,0:06:18.22,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Well, kind of. Let me guess.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:18.34,0:06:22.12,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,This boy's been a real jerk in the past,\Nand you wonder if you should forgive him.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:22.20,0:06:23.03,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Yes, exactly.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:23.38,0:06:25.30,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Well, I think you should\Ngive him another chance.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:25.38,0:06:27.18,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,I mean, after all, he is your boyfriend.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:27.26,0:06:28.32,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Hmm? Oh, Yoli,
Dialogue: 0,0:06:28.62,0:06:30.90,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,according to the latest\Nissue of Girly Girl magazine,
Dialogue: 0,0:06:30.98,0:06:33.76,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Your horoscope says you're going\Nto be lucky in love this month.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:33.84,0:06:34.67,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Wait a second.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:34.75,0:06:35.62,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,You guys have it all wrong.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:35.70,0:06:36.66,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,I don't have a boyfriend.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:36.74,0:06:37.86,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Got it? Yep.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:38.12,0:06:39.56,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,That's what they all say.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:39.64,0:06:41.54,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Ah, young love. Sweet.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:43.50,0:06:44.33,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Hmm.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:44.41,0:06:45.40,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Now I'm really confused.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:46.80,0:06:48.62,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Maybe Davis is right about Ken.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:48.94,0:06:51.82,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,If this is bothering you so much,\Nwhy don't you talk to Ken yourself?
Dialogue: 0,0:06:51.90,0:06:53.32,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,It might make you feel better.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:53.40,0:06:55.28,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,I know that's the right\Nthing to do, Poromon,
Dialogue: 0,0:06:55.36,0:06:56.80,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,but I have this little\Nvoice in my head that
Dialogue: 0,0:06:56.88,0:06:58.74,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,keeps telling me Ken\Nis still untrustworthy.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:58.82,0:07:00.06,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,It's up to you, Yoli,
Dialogue: 0,0:07:00.16,0:07:04.28,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,but listening to little voices in\Nyour head sounds pretty weird to me.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:05.34,0:07:06.17,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Rats!
Dialogue: 0,0:07:06.25,0:07:07.32,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,I don't know anymore.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:07.50,0:07:10.38,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,I just hope I can make\Nthe right decision, Poron.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:12.04,0:07:13.68,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Now, Sting Mom, go get him!
Dialogue: 0,0:07:15.52,0:07:16.40,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Twin Shocker!
Dialogue: 0,0:07:18.06,0:07:19.88,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Maybe if you've practiced more.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:20.22,0:07:21.75,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Spinning, spiking, strike.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:22.68,0:07:26.56,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Stingmon, this insectoid Digimon bugs\Nopponents with his spiking strike attack.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:26.64,0:07:27.76,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Don't try bug spray on him, though.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:27.84,0:07:29.37,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,It'll only make him angry.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:31.22,0:07:36.32,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,He's gone to pieces you showed him Stingmon\Noh can we not do that anymore today Ken
Dialogue: 0,0:07:37.18,0:07:38.01,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Unfortunately,
Dialogue: 0,0:07:38.09,0:07:39.76,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,I don't think that was the\Nlast of the monsters will face
Dialogue: 0,0:07:39.84,0:07:42.86,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,look at all these control spiders\NI'm sorry I ever made them
Dialogue: 0,0:07:42.94,0:07:45.84,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,something's going on and it\Ndoesn't look good Maybe I should
Dialogue: 0,0:07:45.92,0:07:49.80,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,join the other did she destined I\Ndon't think we can do this alone
Dialogue: 0,0:07:59.12,0:08:05.22,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,You have such white fur, your bubble blow\Nattack is almost as big as your appetites.
Dialogue: 0,0:08:05.46,0:08:06.29,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,I'm glad.
Dialogue: 0,0:08:06.37,0:08:07.58,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Next time we'll make s'mores.
Dialogue: 0,0:08:07.66,0:08:08.49,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,How about that?
Dialogue: 0,0:08:08.57,0:08:10.18,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,I wonder where Palmon went to.
Dialogue: 0,0:08:10.26,0:08:12.00,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,If she doesn't hurry back\Nwith those marshmallows,
Dialogue: 0,0:08:12.08,0:08:15.20,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,we're going to have to start\Nroasting some tree bark.
Dialogue: 0,0:08:16.66,0:08:17.49,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,How pretty.
Dialogue: 0,0:08:17.80,0:08:19.74,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,I bet Mimi will love this flower.
Dialogue: 0,0:08:19.88,0:08:22.35,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,I should find more and make her a bouquet.
Dialogue: 0,0:08:28.82,0:08:29.70,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,A human?
Dialogue: 0,0:08:30.04,0:08:31.57,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,But what's she doing here?
Dialogue: 0,0:08:31.98,0:08:34.54,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,I thought only children could\Ncome to the digital world.
Dialogue: 0,0:08:34.62,0:08:36.74,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,She doesn't look like a child to me.
Dialogue: 0,0:08:37.36,0:08:40.02,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,And what's she doing\Nwith that control spire?
Dialogue: 0,0:08:42.14,0:08:44.44,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Hair today, gone tomorrow.
Dialogue: 0,0:08:45.28,0:08:46.48,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Spirit needle!
Dialogue: 0,0:08:52.48,0:08:54.07,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Oh, this doesn't look good.
Dialogue: 0,0:08:54.88,0:08:56.56,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Go, flood the city.
Dialogue: 0,0:08:56.80,0:08:57.63,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Leave it in ruins.
Dialogue: 0,0:08:57.71,0:08:59.08,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Now do as our command!
Dialogue: 0,0:09:00.40,0:09:01.32,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Oh, no!
Dialogue: 0,0:09:01.92,0:09:02.75,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Mimi!
Dialogue: 0,0:09:02.83,0:09:03.66,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Mimi, help!
Dialogue: 0,0:09:04.54,0:09:05.70,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Did you hear that?
Dialogue: 0,0:09:06.20,0:09:07.38,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Mimi, help!
Dialogue: 0,0:09:07.98,0:09:09.72,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,You have to make me digivolve!
Dialogue: 0,0:09:09.80,0:09:11.56,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,He's going to destroy the whole town!
Dialogue: 0,0:09:11.64,0:09:13.12,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Palmon, what are you talking about?
Dialogue: 0,0:09:13.20,0:09:15.08,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Who's going to destroy the town?
Dialogue: 0,0:09:23.00,0:09:24.16,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,It's Golemon!
Dialogue: 0,0:09:25.28,0:09:28.06,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Golemon, a monstrous Digimon\Nmade up of stone and minerals.
Dialogue: 0,0:09:28.14,0:09:30.96,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,His Crimson Curse attack\Noverpowers his enemies.
Dialogue: 0,0:09:31.56,0:09:33.02,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,That was too close.
Dialogue: 0,0:09:39.56,0:09:41.04,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Are you okay?
Dialogue: 0,0:09:41.72,0:09:42.68,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,I'm all right.
Dialogue: 0,0:09:42.98,0:09:44.72,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,I just need to rest.
Dialogue: 0,0:09:45.36,0:09:46.19,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Go, Mimi.
Dialogue: 0,0:09:46.96,0:09:48.84,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Golemon's gonna destroy the dam.
Dialogue: 0,0:09:51.54,0:09:52.72,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Wait, stop.
Dialogue: 0,0:09:53.02,0:09:54.08,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Don't do anything.
Dialogue: 0,0:09:54.16,0:09:54.99,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Stop!
Dialogue: 0,0:09:55.07,0:09:56.90,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,The town is diviseless, you big bully!
Dialogue: 0,0:10:00.52,0:10:01.70,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,There's no time.
Dialogue: 0,0:10:01.96,0:10:03.08,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,You must warn them.
Dialogue: 0,0:10:03.34,0:10:04.78,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,And I need to sleep.
Dialogue: 0,0:10:05.82,0:10:06.96,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Hold on, hold on!
Dialogue: 0,0:10:08.64,0:10:10.30,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,I can't do this alone.
Dialogue: 0,0:10:11.40,0:10:13.16,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,I need help!
Dialogue: 0,0:10:14.54,0:10:15.92,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Somebody help me!
Dialogue: 0,0:10:18.20,0:10:19.76,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Digital Gate, open!
Dialogue: 0,0:10:26.82,0:10:28.58,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Mimi, we're right here!
Dialogue: 0,0:10:29.38,0:10:31.90,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,We came as fast as we could. Are you okay?
Dialogue: 0,0:10:32.14,0:10:33.08,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,What's going on?
Dialogue: 0,0:10:34.12,0:10:35.00,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,It's Golemon.
Dialogue: 0,0:10:35.34,0:10:37.84,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,He's going to destroy the\Ndam and flood the city.
Dialogue: 0,0:10:37.92,0:10:39.12,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Why would he do that?
Dialogue: 0,0:10:39.20,0:10:40.66,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Did he just freak out or something?
Dialogue: 0,0:10:40.74,0:10:42.27,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,We're running out of time!
Dialogue: 0,0:10:43.42,0:10:44.48,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Where's the tunnel?
Dialogue: 0,0:10:44.56,0:10:45.92,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,At the end of the ravine,
Dialogue: 0,0:10:46.00,0:10:49.24,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,all the Digimon down there will\Nbe up to their digi-ears in water.
Dialogue: 0,0:10:49.32,0:10:50.34,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Hey, don't worry.
Dialogue: 0,0:10:50.74,0:10:51.84,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,We're all over it.
Dialogue: 0,0:10:52.50,0:10:54.79,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Huh, let's take care of that rock head!
Dialogue: 0,0:10:59.00,0:11:01.77,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,First we're gonna have\Nto get him off that dam!
Dialogue: 0,0:11:08.08,0:11:09.26,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,It's my turn!
Dialogue: 0,0:11:09.54,0:11:10.78,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Blue Thunder!
Dialogue: 0,0:11:11.12,0:11:12.36,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Gold Rush!
Dialogue: 0,0:11:12.84,0:11:13.92,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Double Stars!
Dialogue: 0,0:11:15.52,0:11:16.86,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Great shot, guys!
Dialogue: 0,0:11:18.58,0:11:19.41,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Huh?
Dialogue: 0,0:11:22.30,0:11:24.34,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,The shot didn't even freeze him.
Dialogue: 0,0:11:24.56,0:11:25.80,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,He's too strong.
Dialogue: 0,0:11:26.08,0:11:28.24,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Look for his Dark Ring and destroy it.
Dialogue: 0,0:11:28.32,0:11:29.28,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,I'm all over it.
Dialogue: 0,0:11:31.90,0:11:33.68,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,I don't see a Dark Ring.
Dialogue: 0,0:11:33.92,0:11:36.54,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,No Dark Ring, that means\Nhe's not being controlled.
Dialogue: 0,0:11:36.62,0:11:39.68,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Yeah, just like that Thunder\NMon I fought last time.
Dialogue: 0,0:11:46.04,0:11:46.88,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Pegasus Mon.
Dialogue: 0,0:11:50.60,0:11:51.70,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,That did it!
Dialogue: 0,0:11:53.86,0:11:55.14,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Crimson Feet!
Dialogue: 0,0:11:57.86,0:11:59.34,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Hey, that's not fair!
Dialogue: 0,0:12:00.32,0:12:01.28,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,My turn!
Dialogue: 0,0:12:03.22,0:12:04.50,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Double star!
Dialogue: 0,0:12:06.16,0:12:06.99,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Shurimon!
Dialogue: 0,0:12:08.80,0:12:10.58,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Look, he's going to do it!
Dialogue: 0,0:12:34.50,0:12:37.46,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,There are millions of gallons\Npouring out of that hole.
Dialogue: 0,0:12:37.54,0:12:38.70,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,We have to stop it.
Dialogue: 0,0:12:44.42,0:12:45.76,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Oh, no, it's out!
Dialogue: 0,0:12:47.34,0:12:49.42,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Quick, you guys! Stop the water!
Dialogue: 0,0:12:49.60,0:12:50.72,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,You heard the lady!
Dialogue: 0,0:12:51.78,0:12:53.26,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,I'll take care of this!
Dialogue: 0,0:12:55.82,0:12:57.30,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Rosetta Stone!
Dialogue: 0,0:13:03.50,0:13:05.22,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Take that, you big rocket!
Dialogue: 0,0:13:09.60,0:13:12.07,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Sorry, but I've already had my bath today!
Dialogue: 0,0:13:14.42,0:13:16.60,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Kusanagi!
Dialogue: 0,0:13:17.84,0:13:19.94,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Thunder Blast!
Dialogue: 0,0:13:20.52,0:13:22.06,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Go dead now!
Dialogue: 0,0:13:28.78,0:13:30.88,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Rock Kraken!
Dialogue: 0,0:13:46.86,0:13:50.84,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,There must be easier ways to water\Nthe plants. You're telling me.
Dialogue: 0,0:13:51.36,0:13:54.96,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,That was awesome. That's\Nwhat I call teamwork. Oh no!
Dialogue: 0,0:13:57.96,0:14:01.36,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Oh no, he's climbing up the dam\Nagain Doesn't he know when to stop?
Dialogue: 0,0:14:01.44,0:14:04.38,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,I don't think so Well, he\Nhas a rock for a brain,
Dialogue: 0,0:14:04.46,0:14:06.52,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,he can't be that bright There's no way the
Dialogue: 0,0:14:06.60,0:14:09.34,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Digimon can stop that\Nmuch water. Let's go!
Dialogue: 0,0:14:10.56,0:14:12.86,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Why is he so intent on flooding the town?
Dialogue: 0,0:14:12.94,0:14:16.52,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Golemon doesn't seem to care that there\Nare millions of Digimon down there.
Dialogue: 0,0:14:16.60,0:14:18.42,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,That's why we have to stop him.
Dialogue: 0,0:14:19.10,0:14:20.40,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Those poor Digimon.
Dialogue: 0,0:14:20.70,0:14:22.78,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,How do we stop Golemon\Nwithout hurting him?
Dialogue: 0,0:14:22.86,0:14:25.92,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,We have no choice but to\Nresort to extreme measures.
Dialogue: 0,0:14:26.42,0:14:28.80,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,And exactly what do you\Nmean by that, Davis?
Dialogue: 0,0:14:28.88,0:14:30.23,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,We have to destroy him.
Dialogue: 0,0:14:30.56,0:14:32.24,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Have you gone completely nuts?
Dialogue: 0,0:14:32.32,0:14:33.20,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,He's a Digimon.
Dialogue: 0,0:14:33.62,0:14:35.40,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,He's still a living creature, Davis.
Dialogue: 0,0:14:35.48,0:14:36.88,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,We'll have to think of another plan.
Dialogue: 0,0:14:36.96,0:14:38.94,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,If you've got a better\Nplan, I'd love to hear it.
Dialogue: 0,0:14:39.02,0:14:39.88,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Let's get him!
Dialogue: 0,0:14:39.96,0:14:42.26,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,What if we keep trying to protect the dam?
Dialogue: 0,0:14:42.34,0:14:43.58,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Now who sounds crazy?
Dialogue: 0,0:14:43.80,0:14:45.62,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,He swatted our Digimon like flies.
Dialogue: 0,0:14:45.70,0:14:47.92,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,We have to take out\NBolomon to protect the dam.
Dialogue: 0,0:14:48.00,0:14:49.53,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,At least let's try, Davis.
Dialogue: 0,0:14:49.76,0:14:51.14,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Look, Yoli, the longer we fight him,
Dialogue: 0,0:14:51.22,0:14:53.16,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,the better the chance of\Nhim destroying that dam.
Dialogue: 0,0:14:53.24,0:14:54.70,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,There are millions of lives at stake.
Dialogue: 0,0:14:54.78,0:14:55.80,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,We had no choice.
Dialogue: 0,0:14:56.00,0:14:57.56,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,There's got to be a better way.
Dialogue: 0,0:14:57.64,0:14:58.54,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,It's too late, Yoli.
Dialogue: 0,0:14:58.62,0:14:59.74,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,We have to act now.
Dialogue: 0,0:15:00.20,0:15:04.36,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Oh, if we destroy Bolomon, we're\Nno better than Ken and Zudomon.
Dialogue: 0,0:15:04.52,0:15:06.99,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,There must be a solution without violence.
Dialogue: 0,0:15:07.12,0:15:08.28,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,I agree with Yoli.
Dialogue: 0,0:15:08.90,0:15:12.54,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,If we destroy Golemon, then we'll\Njust be sinking to Ken's level.
Dialogue: 0,0:15:12.62,0:15:14.32,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Right, Cody? Wrong, Cody.
Dialogue: 0,0:15:14.50,0:15:16.04,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,We have to do the right thing.
Dialogue: 0,0:15:16.12,0:15:18.06,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Being a hero isn't always pretty.
Dialogue: 0,0:15:18.30,0:15:20.72,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Maybe Ken did what he had to\Ndo to save people's lives.
Dialogue: 0,0:15:20.80,0:15:22.94,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Why does Davis always stick up for Ken,
Dialogue: 0,0:15:23.02,0:15:25.86,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,even after he's seen him do such\Nhorrible things to the Digimon?
Dialogue: 0,0:15:25.94,0:15:29.60,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Does he really think Ken has changed, or\Nhas his hair gel leaked into his brain?
Dialogue: 0,0:15:29.68,0:15:32.90,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,This might sound crazy, but I think\Nwe should ask Ken for his help.
Dialogue: 0,0:15:32.98,0:15:33.81,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Huh?
Dialogue: 0,0:15:33.89,0:15:35.37,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Have you lost your mind, Mimi?
Dialogue: 0,0:15:35.50,0:15:36.58,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Give me your D3.
Dialogue: 0,0:15:38.28,0:15:39.80,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,You have got to be kidding.
Dialogue: 0,0:15:39.88,0:15:40.90,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,I'm totally serious.
Dialogue: 0,0:15:40.98,0:15:42.10,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Gollumon's too powerful.
Dialogue: 0,0:15:42.18,0:15:43.62,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,We need all the help we can get.
Dialogue: 0,0:15:43.70,0:15:44.82,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,But he's dangerous.
Dialogue: 0,0:15:45.14,0:15:46.32,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Don't argue with me.
Dialogue: 0,0:15:46.74,0:15:49.34,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Mimi, how do you know if we can trust him?
Dialogue: 0,0:15:49.66,0:15:51.60,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Maybe I am being too hard on Kim.
Dialogue: 0,0:15:51.80,0:15:53.00,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,I really do want him to come.
Dialogue: 0,0:15:53.08,0:15:54.37,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,I just can't admit it.
Dialogue: 0,0:16:01.74,0:16:02.62,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Hawkmon, no!
Dialogue: 0,0:16:04.12,0:16:05.06,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Ready, guys?
Dialogue: 0,0:16:05.86,0:16:07.12,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Grim's in curse!
Dialogue: 0,0:16:19.78,0:16:20.88,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Run for it!
Dialogue: 0,0:16:21.06,0:16:22.53,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,He's gonna break the dam!
Dialogue: 0,0:16:29.42,0:16:30.38,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,It's Stingmon!
Dialogue: 0,0:16:32.98,0:16:34.58,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Stingmon, give him your best shot!
Dialogue: 0,0:16:34.66,0:16:35.72,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Here goes nothing!
Dialogue: 0,0:16:35.88,0:16:36.71,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,It's Ken!
Dialogue: 0,0:16:36.79,0:16:37.76,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,He came to help us!
Dialogue: 0,0:16:37.84,0:16:39.16,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Way to go, yeah!
Dialogue: 0,0:16:39.48,0:16:41.36,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,I knew he'd come! Me too!
Dialogue: 0,0:16:41.72,0:16:43.54,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Now Golemon has his hands full!
Dialogue: 0,0:16:44.86,0:16:47.50,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Wow, Ken and Stingmon\Nare defending the town!
Dialogue: 0,0:16:47.58,0:16:51.58,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,If Stingmon hadn't stopped Golemon,\Nthe dam would be history by now!
Dialogue: 0,0:16:55.72,0:16:56.66,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Look, everyone!
Dialogue: 0,0:16:56.82,0:16:58.90,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Palmon's waking up! Golemon!
Dialogue: 0,0:16:59.36,0:17:00.77,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,He's not what you think!
Dialogue: 0,0:17:05.94,0:17:07.66,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,He's not even a real Digimon!
Dialogue: 0,0:17:07.84,0:17:10.78,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,I know I sound crazy, but you\Nhave to believe me on this.
Dialogue: 0,0:17:10.86,0:17:12.16,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,What are you talking about?
Dialogue: 0,0:17:12.24,0:17:15.66,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,I was walking through the woods and I\Nheard something, so I went to check it out.
Dialogue: 0,0:17:15.74,0:17:17.58,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,That's when I saw this strange woman.
Dialogue: 0,0:17:17.66,0:17:20.19,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,She was casting a spell\Non a control spire.
Dialogue: 0,0:17:22.30,0:17:24.86,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,There was all this bright\Nlight I could barely see.
Dialogue: 0,0:17:24.94,0:17:27.46,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,And then the control spire became Golemon.
Dialogue: 0,0:17:27.54,0:17:29.60,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Hey, guys, I just thought of something.
Dialogue: 0,0:17:29.68,0:17:32.16,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Thundermine must have been one\Nof those control spires, too.
Dialogue: 0,0:17:32.24,0:17:35.16,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,I bet Cam probably figured that\Nout during the last battle.
Dialogue: 0,0:17:35.24,0:17:37.26,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,That must be why he ordered\NStigmund to destroy him.
Dialogue: 0,0:17:37.34,0:17:39.04,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,He knew he wasn't a real Digimon.
Dialogue: 0,0:17:39.12,0:17:40.84,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,That's why Golemon attacked the dam.
Dialogue: 0,0:17:40.92,0:17:43.27,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,He's a control spire under a dark spell.
Dialogue: 0,0:17:43.82,0:17:44.98,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Stingmon, look out!
Dialogue: 0,0:17:45.28,0:17:46.32,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,I was wrong.
Dialogue: 0,0:17:46.54,0:17:47.48,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Ken has changed.
Dialogue: 0,0:17:47.74,0:17:50.22,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,I always assumed that he was\Njust as ruthless as before,
Dialogue: 0,0:17:50.30,0:17:53.01,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,but now he's trying to\Nsave the digital world.
Dialogue: 0,0:17:53.18,0:17:54.34,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,I'm sorry, Ken.
Dialogue: 0,0:17:54.60,0:17:55.54,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,I was wrong.
Dialogue: 0,0:18:02.00,0:18:03.29,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Hawkmon, are you okay?
Dialogue: 0,0:18:03.50,0:18:05.46,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,I feel rather strange right now.
Dialogue: 0,0:18:08.34,0:18:10.62,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Oh, I know I was wrong.
Dialogue: 0,0:18:30.06,0:18:32.40,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Up on, Digivolve.
Dialogue: 0,0:18:56.90,0:18:58.86,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Golemon is really an evil control spire.
Dialogue: 0,0:18:58.94,0:19:00.28,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,He's not a living Digimon.
Dialogue: 0,0:19:00.36,0:19:01.95,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,So give him all you've got.
Dialogue: 0,0:19:03.88,0:19:04.71,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Ahhhhhhhhhhh!
Dialogue: 0,0:19:10.18,0:19:12.30,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Excuse me! Blaster!
Dialogue: 0,0:19:18.84,0:19:20.76,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Stingmon, attack!
Dialogue: 0,0:19:22.10,0:19:22.93,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Spikes!
Dialogue: 0,0:19:35.16,0:19:36.62,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,He's weakened. Get him!
Dialogue: 0,0:19:39.38,0:19:40.32,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Glide Horn!
Dialogue: 0,0:19:46.56,0:19:47.76,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,They did it!
Dialogue: 0,0:19:48.14,0:19:49.68,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Just in time for lunch.
Dialogue: 0,0:19:52.90,0:19:54.56,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,I won't make any excuses.
Dialogue: 0,0:19:54.94,0:19:56.88,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,And I'm sorry for what I've done.
Dialogue: 0,0:20:00.22,0:20:02.00,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Thanks for coming when we called you, Ken.
Dialogue: 0,0:20:02.08,0:20:03.66,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,and we were nearly finished back there.
Dialogue: 0,0:20:03.74,0:20:06.20,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,It's the least I could do after\Nall the trouble I've caused.
Dialogue: 0,0:20:06.28,0:20:08.02,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,I want you to know I have\Nnothing to do with that
Dialogue: 0,0:20:08.10,0:20:10.80,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,weird woman who turns Control\NSpires into Dark Digimon.
Dialogue: 0,0:20:10.88,0:20:12.92,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Wormon and I discovered\Nthat she is able to recharge
Dialogue: 0,0:20:13.00,0:20:15.80,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,the old Control Spires through\Nsome sort of dark magic.
Dialogue: 0,0:20:15.88,0:20:19.26,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Ken, if you knew about the Control\NSpires, why didn't you say something?
Dialogue: 0,0:20:19.34,0:20:20.60,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Well, I...
Dialogue: 0,0:20:20.68,0:20:23.82,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,We made the mess, so we wanted\Nto clean it up by ourselves.
Dialogue: 0,0:20:23.90,0:20:27.04,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,I guess you should have\Ncalled a maid service, Wormon.
Dialogue: 0,0:20:27.12,0:20:29.84,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,I wasn't sure if you guys\Nwere going to believe me.
Dialogue: 0,0:20:29.92,0:20:32.46,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,I would have, but the rest of the\Nguys would have been a hard sell.
Dialogue: 0,0:20:32.54,0:20:33.76,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,We need to start over.
Dialogue: 0,0:20:33.84,0:20:34.96,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Why don't you join us?
Dialogue: 0,0:20:35.04,0:20:36.42,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,I'm sorry, but I can't.
Dialogue: 0,0:20:36.92,0:20:38.80,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,We can figure this out together.
Dialogue: 0,0:20:39.30,0:20:41.50,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Ken, please, at least think it over.
Dialogue: 0,0:20:41.76,0:20:43.23,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,We really need your help.
Dialogue: 0,0:20:43.98,0:20:44.81,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Huh? Email?
Dialogue: 0,0:20:45.50,0:20:47.15,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Thanks for helping us today.
Dialogue: 0,0:20:48.22,0:20:51.46,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,I can't wait for the day when\Nyou decide to join us, Ken.
Dialogue: 0,0:20:51.54,0:20:52.37,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,You'll leave.
Dialogue: 0,0:20:53.32,0:20:54.96,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Don't worry, I think he'll come around.
Dialogue: 0,0:20:55.04,0:20:56.86,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,I don't blame him for being cautious.
Dialogue: 0,0:20:56.94,0:20:58.56,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,We were wrong not to\Ngive him a second chance.
Dialogue: 0,0:20:58.64,0:21:01.52,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Besides, we can always\Nuse another Digidestined.
Dialogue: 0,0:21:01.68,0:21:04.64,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Will Ken join the rest\Nof the Digidestined?
Dialogue: 0,0:21:05.00,0:21:09.18,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Find out on the next\NDigimon Digital Monsters.
Dialogue: 1,0:21:16.46,0:21:22.46,Ashita Karaoke,,0,0,0,,Chotto matte mite dare datte kinou to maru de chigau
Dialogue: 1,0:21:22.46,0:21:28.50,Ashita Karaoke,,0,0,0,,Chotto mite mite yokogao no shiruetto mo otona sa
Dialogue: 1,0:21:28.50,0:21:34.52,Ashita Karaoke,,0,0,0,,Chotto kimi kimi iiwake wo shitai kimochi mo wakaru
Dialogue: 0,0:21:28.64,0:21:32.72,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,I'm just a little nervous\Nfor what I want to do. I
Dialogue: 0,0:21:32.80,0:21:36.90,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,I wonder if this person is
Dialogue: 1,0:21:34.52,0:21:40.61,Ashita Karaoke,,0,0,0,,Datte yo no naka kore ja maru de natte nai jan
Dialogue: 0,0:21:36.98,0:21:41.30,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Like raising money. Oh-oh!
Dialogue: 1,0:21:40.61,0:21:46.20,Ashita Karaoke,,0,0,0,,Da ne! Kimochi ii kuuki wo
Dialogue: 0,0:21:42.04,0:21:43.22,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,It's a heavy feeling
Dialogue: 0,0:21:44.60,0:21:49.86,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,I'm gonna hold it to...
Dialogue: 1,0:21:46.65,0:21:52.41,Ashita Karaoke,,0,0,0,,Ima! Suitakute shou ga nai shou ga nai
Dialogue: 0,0:21:49.94,0:21:51.98,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,I don't think so...
Dialogue: 1,0:21:52.41,0:21:58.21,Ashita Karaoke,,0,0,0,,Ashita wa atashi no kaze ga fuku kara ne
Dialogue: 0,0:21:52.64,0:21:53.62,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Tomorrow will be the
Dialogue: 0,0:21:53.70,0:21:59.76,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Wind in my heart, I want
Dialogue: 1,0:21:58.21,0:22:04.13,Ashita Karaoke,,0,0,0,,Sekaijuu no doa akete oite hoshii
Dialogue: 0,0:21:59.84,0:22:01.96,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,to open the door to the\Nworld I want to open the
Dialogue: 0,0:22:02.04,0:22:08.58,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Door for tomorrow. I\Nwant to open the door for
Dialogue: 1,0:22:04.13,0:22:10.30,Ashita Karaoke,,0,0,0,,Ashita wa atashi no kaze ga fuku kara ne
Dialogue: 0,0:22:08.66,0:22:10.90,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,You. I want
Dialogue: 1,0:22:10.30,0:22:18.80,Ashita Karaoke,,0,0,0,,Kimi no sono yowamushi wo mouretsu ni fukitobasuyo
Dialogue: 0,0:22:10.98,0:22:17.42,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,To open the.
Dialogue: 0,0:22:17.50,0:22:22.70,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Door for you. Gorgeous love!
Dialogue: 1,0:22:20.65,0:22:29.42,Ashita Karaoke,,0,0,0,,Gorgeous na jinsei wo!
